          "Login.gov combines expert fraud and operations analysis, detection tools, continuous monitoring, and close collaboration across teams to strengthen protections across the platform’s services. This approach improves Login.gov’s detection capabilities, strengthens operational response, and enables the team to share insights on emerging fraud trends with agency partners.",
          "That work requires careful balance. Strong fraud controls must protect sensitive government programs and the people they serve while preserving access for users who need to complete important tasks online. Login.gov’s anti-fraud experts guide that balance by assessing risk, improving processes, and refining protections based on real-world patterns and user impact.",
